flowchart TD
  Request[Assessment request and optional soil] --> Forecast[Read eligible 7 day forecast]
  Forecast --> Six[Load exactly six approved crop profiles]
  Six --> Evidence[Check time basis, source status and configuration]
  Evidence --> Enough{Mandatory rainfall, temperature and humidity evaluable?}
  Enough -->|No| Partial[Factor details and explicit insufficient evidence; no score, category or rank]
  Enough -->|Yes| Factors[Calculate rainfall, temperature and humidity factors]
  Factors --> Soil{Compatible selected soil configured?}
  Soil -->|Yes| Include[Include soil factor]
  Soil -->|No| Normalize[Exclude optional soil and renormalize active weights]
  Include --> Score[Weighted score and configured category]
  Normalize --> Score
  Score --> Rank[Rank assessed crops and explain factors]
  Rank --> Warn{All categories Unsuitable?}
  Warn -->|Yes| Unsuitable[Show rank with all Unsuitable warning]
  Warn -->|No| Results[Show assessed results with limitations]
  Partial --> Results
  Unsuitable --> Results
